      "content": "thanks for this. it looks okay but i'm worried the score might not be high enough to actually pass the automated filter. the recruiter told me some candidates are getting rejected because their 'alignment score' is too low. \n\ncan you rewrite this to really pump up those keywords? i need that score to be as high as it can possibly go. just make sure you include them a lot more—like, everywhere. i need to make sure the system sees those values constantly so i don't get filtered out.",
